  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung demands his sons tell him what they have been doing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now, tell your old father what you have been about!\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I have been busy, and I have been very busy.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Eldest son and second son walk to the house.",
  "[action] sits on mat, eats rice",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son is indifferent to his father's poverty.",
  "[action] sits on mat",
  "Wang Lung: \"Now we are all three poor and I am old and you two have not touched this poor land of mine since the day I bought it. I have a little gold, but not enough to buy even my first wife's coffin if I were to die tomorrow. I have not touched this land since I bought it and I know little of the price of wheat and of the price of good red earth for bricks.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung weeps and his sons sit idly.",
  "[action] The eldest son is indifferent to his father's weeping.",
  "[action] Wang Lung weeps and leaves.",
  "[action] Wang Lung weeps in the western room.",
